,"每個人平均花費多少？",[[[["E:TWD_200_TO_400"],"$200-400",2,null,"$200 到 $400","0ahUKEwjYw_yiw9KWAxXnoK8BHZS9BzwQ3YcHCJ8BKAA"]],1],null,null,"平均每人消費金額",null,"0ahUKEwjYw_yiw9KWAxXnoK8BHZS9BzwQ3IcHCJ4BKAg",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2],[["GUIDED_DINING_FOOD_ASPECT"],"餐點",null,null,null,"餐點",null,"0ahUKEwjYw_yiw9KWAxXnoK8BHZS9BzwQ3IcHCKABKAk",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwjYw_yiw9KWAxXnoK8BHZS9BzwQ3IcHCKEBKAo",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjYw_yiw9KWAxXnoK8BHZS9BzwQ3IcHCKIBKAs",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_GROUP_SIZE"],"這裡適合幾個人的聚會？",null,[[[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_ONE"],"1 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjYw_yiw9KWAxXnoK8BHZS9BzwQ3YcHCKQBKAA"],[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_TWO"],"2 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjYw_yiw9KWAxXnoK8BHZS9BzwQ3YcHCKUBKAE"],[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_THREE_TO_FOUR"],"3 到 4 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjYw_yiw9KWAxXnoK8BHZS9BzwQ3YcHCKYBKAI"],[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_SUITABLE_FOR_ALL"],"多人聚餐/單人用餐皆宜",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjYw_yiw9KWAxXnoK8BHZS9BzwQ3YcHCKcBKAM"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwjYw_yiw9KWAxXnoK8BHZS9BzwQ3IcHCKMBKAw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["因為長期生活在士林，所以很常去、很喜歡的店家。雖然裝潢有點老舊，但很有家的感覺，老闆娘也總是很熱情的招呼客人。\n\n店內的餐具是自取的，而且也有麥茶可以續杯。如果點套餐，飯跟湯都是可以續的。尤其是他們家的飯，真的好好吃好Q又粒粒分明。我有好幾次想回訪，都是因為覺得吃到他們的飯太幸福了！而且套餐種類很多，自己是因為有在健身，所以烤雞腿套餐是最均衡也最常點的。但炸牡蠣、炸豬排也非常好吃。\n\n其他品項還有點過蝦蘆手卷、炒烏龍麵、茶碗蒸、親子丼跟章魚沙拉，覺得都很對我的胃口。\n\n最後真的很推薦所有在士林生活的人，都可以去試試看。雖然他不是最華麗別緻的店家，但絕對是那種，你會在結束的忙碌一天後想著「啊 真想去吃」的療癒系店家，用家庭式的氛圍感接納每個身心俱疲的人。",null,[0,55]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11902887710582547036/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDZEZWSVFuaFVSRkpXVWpOb2FXVkhXbHBqTUZwWllYcE9kV0Z0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11902887710582547036/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDZEZWSVFuaFVSRkpXVW